  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conversatorios (Dialogue spaces) between State Security Forces and Civil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is the continuation of previous efforts to strengthening the Colombian Armed Forces&apos; willingness and abilities to actively participate in peacebuilding in Colombia. The main objective of this project is to achieve better levels of trust and communication between State&apos;s security forces and civil society both at national level and regional level, particularly in 12 (out of the 16) most conflict-affected regions in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
